    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553">

                <pb facs="0679" n="571" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg571"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Snowden to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-02-14"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received February 14.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Snowden anticipating a possible refusal of payment of reasonable indemnity or
                    return of the missionary and further postponement of decision on the part of the
                    minister for foreign affairs with whom he expects to have an interview on
                    Thursday, asks whether he will be authorized to propose arbitration of the whole
                    case. He asks for definite instructions as to what he should do if the Spanish
                    Government should reject that proposition.</p>
            </div>
